Changes made in this copy:
  SKILL.md is an adaptation for a Claude Code setup. The unmodified original is
  linked at https://github.com/rebelytics/one-skill-to-rule-them-all. Content specific to the
  Cowork environment (read-only skill mounts, workspace staging directories, the
  present_files tool, handoff-doc mode) was removed from the adaptation because
  it does not apply here; it remains intact in the upstream original. The
  observation-numbering shell snippets were changed from GNU grep -P to POSIX
  equivalents for macOS compatibility.

Public edition changes: generalizes personal paths and permissions, removes private
review history, and links the upstream original instead of bundling it.
